# Phase 2b — SQLite + SQLCipher local encrypted DB
#
# No environment variables are required for normal operation.
# All data is stored locally and encrypted on-device:
#   Windows: %APPDATA%\com.nobugonpu.aibbc\
#   macOS:   ~/Library/Application Support/com.nobugonpu.aibbc/
#
# The encryption key is derived at runtime from the user's master password
# (PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256, 600,000 iterations). It is NEVER written to disk.
#
# Phase 2c — Claude API / AI features (future)
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
